<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Rapport IA des réservations</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            margin: 140px 36px 88px 36px;
        }

        body {
            font-family: DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #0f172a;
            margin: 0;
            background: #f8fafc;
        }

        .report-header {
            position: fixed;
            top: -110px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 100px;
            padding: 18px 36px 12px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f766e, #1d4ed8);
            color: #ffffff;
            border-bottom: 4px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
        }

        .header-inner,
        .hero-top,
        .stats,
        .filter-grid {
            display: table;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .header-brand,
        .header-meta,
        .hero-title,
        .hero-badge,
        .stat,
        .filter-item {
            display: table-cell;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        .header-brand { width: 65%; }
        .header-meta { text-align: right; }
        .header-meta-box {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
        }
        .header-meta-label {
            margin: 0 0 4px;
            font-size: 9px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            opacity: 0.78;
        }
        .header-meta-value { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }

        .brand-row { display: table; width: 100%; }
        .brand-logo,
        .brand-copy { display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; }
        .brand-logo img {
            width: 58px; height: 58px; object-fit: contain; margin-right: 14px;
            border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); padding: 6px;
        }
        .brand-kicker {
            margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.85;
        }
        .brand-title { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.1; }
        .brand-subtitle { margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.92; }

        .report-footer {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: -66px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 54px;
            padding: 14px 36px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 9px;
            background: #ffffff;
        }

        .footer-inner { display: table; width: 100%; }
        .footer-inner > div { display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; }
        .footer-right { text-align: right; }
        .page-number::after { content: "Page " counter(page) " / " counter(pages); font-weight: 700; color: #1e3a8a; }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98), rgba(226, 239, 255, 0.84));
            border: 1px solid #dbeafe;
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 18px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
        }
        .hero-title h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 21px; color: #0f172a; }
        .hero-title p { margin: 6px 0 0; color: #475569; font-size: 10px; }
        .hero-badge { text-align: right; }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 999px;
            background: #dbeafe; color: #1d4ed8; font-weight: 700; font-size: 10px;
        }

        .stats { margin-bottom: 14px; table-layout: fixed; }
        .stat { padding-right: 10px; }
        .stat-card {
            background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 12px 14px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
        }
        .stat-label { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 9px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #64748b; }
        .stat-value { margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; }

        .section {
            margin-top: 16px;
            padding: 16px 18px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #dbeafe;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
        }
        .section h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 16px; color: #0f172a; }
        .section p { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #475569; font-size: 10px; }

        .filter-grid { table-layout: fixed; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .filter-item { padding-right: 10px; }
        .filter-card {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 10px 12px;
        }
        .filter-label { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 9px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #64748b; }
        .filter-value { margin: 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; }

        .report-content {
            padding: 12px 14px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .muted { color: #64748b; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    {% set totalReservations = reservations|length %}
    {% set confirmedReservations = 0 %}
    {% set pendingReservations = 0 %}
    {% set cancelledReservations = 0 %}
    {% set totalPeople = 0 %}

    {% for reservation in reservations %}
        {% set reservationStatus = reservation.activiteEcologique ? (reservation.dateReservation and reservation.dateReservation|date('Y-m-d') > "now"|date('Y-m-d') ? 'pending' : 'confirmed') : 'cancelled' %}
        {% set totalPeople = totalPeople + (reservation.nombrePersonnes|default(0)) %}
        {% if reservationStatus == 'confirmed' %}
            {% set confirmedReservations = confirmedReservations + 1 %}
        {% elseif reservationStatus == 'pending' %}
            {% set pendingReservations = pendingReservations + 1 %}
        {% else %}
            {% set cancelledReservations = cancelledReservations + 1 %}
        {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}

    <div class="report-header">
        <div class="header-inner">
            <div class="header-brand">
                <div class="brand-row">
                    <div class="brand-logo">
                        <img src="{{ absolute_url(asset('assets/images/logoEco.png')) }}" alt="EcoMarine">
                    </div>
                    <div class="brand-copy">
                        <p class="brand-kicker">EcoMarine</p>
                        <h2 class="brand-title">Rapport IA des réservations</h2>
                        <p class="brand-subtitle">Analyse personnalisée des filtres actifs et synthèse générée par l'IA.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="header-meta">
                <div class="header-meta-box">
                    <p class="header-meta-label">Généré le</p>
                    <p class="header-meta-value">{{ generatedAt|date('d/m/Y H:i') }}</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="report-footer">
        <div class="footer-inner">
            <div>EcoMarine - Écotourisme et recherche marine à Kuriat, Monastir</div>
            <div class="footer-right"><span class="page-number"></span></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero">
        <div class="hero-top">
            <div class="hero-title">
                <h1>Résumé du rapport IA</h1>
                <p>Document généré à partir des réservations filtrées dans la liste courante.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-badge">
                <span class="badge">{{ totalReservations }} réservation{{ totalReservations > 1 ? 's' : '' }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">
            <div class="stat-card">
                <p class="stat-label">Total</p>
                <p class="stat-value">{{ totalReservations }}</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
            <div class="stat-card">
                <p class="stat-label">Confirmées</p>
                <p class="stat-value">{{ confirmedReservations }}</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
            <div class="stat-card">
                <p class="stat-label">En attente</p>
                <p class="stat-value">{{ pendingReservations }}</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat" style="padding-right: 0;">
            <div class="stat-card">
                <p class="stat-label">Annulées</p>
                <p class="stat-value">{{ cancelledReservations }}</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Filtres appliqués</h2>
        <p>Le rapport reflète les paramètres actifs au moment de l'export.</p>
        <div class="filter-grid">
            <div class="filter-item"><div class="filter-card"><p class="filter-label">Recherche</p><p class="filter-value">{{ filters.q|default('Aucune') }}</p></div></div>
            <div class="filter-item"><div class="filter-card"><p class="filter-label">Champ</p><p class="filter-value">{{ filters.field|default('all') }}</p></div></div>
            <div class="filter-item"><div class="filter-card"><p class="filter-label">Statut</p><p class="filter-value">{{ filters.status|default('all') }}</p></div></div>
            <div class="filter-item" style="padding-right: 0;"><div class="filter-card"><p class="filter-label">Période</p><p class="filter-value">{{ filters.date_from|default('') }} → {{ filters.date_to|default('') }}</p></div></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Rapport IA</h2>
        <p>Analyse structurée générée à partir des réservations incluses dans cet export PDF.</p>
        <div class="report-content">{{ report }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Détails de synthèse</h2>
        <p>Indicateurs de lecture rapide pour accompagner l'analyse.</p>
        <div class="filter-grid">
            <div class="filter-item"><div class="filter-card"><p class="filter-label">Total personnes</p><p class="filter-value">{{ totalPeople }}</p></div></div>
            <div class="filter-item"><div class="filter-card"><p class="filter-label">Réservations filtrées</p><p class="filter-value">{{ totalReservations }}</p></div></div>
            <div class="filter-item"><div class="filter-card"><p class="filter-label">Lecture</p><p class="filter-value">{{ report|length > 0 ? 'Rapport prêt' : 'Aucun contenu' }}</p></div></div>
            <div class="filter-item" style="padding-right: 0;"><div class="filter-card"><p class="filter-label">Source</p><p class="filter-value">AI Groq + données locales</p></div></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
